tradition-component: description

Shadow Arts is the practitioner-facing form of Kung Fu Jutsu. It teaches fixed, fully developed named techniques preserved by a school, lineage, manual, or other institutional instance. A Shadow Artist does not improvise new effects; they learn authored Jutsu and execute those known forms reliably.
